##############################
## What this repository holds
##############################
# energy-flow-x-info, the public showcase of EnergyFlowX: Markdown, images, sample
# JSON payloads, and the scripts under reference-comparisons/ that regenerate the
# reference figures.
#
# There is no Java, Maven, Gradle, Eclipse or NetBeans here. This file used to
# carry the boilerplate for all five, plus three separate spellings of the same
# .idea/ rule, which made it impossible to see what was actually being ignored.

